      <Desc>THE ORGANIZATION IS CO-PUBLISHER OF INDEPENDENT VOTER NEWS, AN OPEN NEWS PLATFORM FOR INDEPENDENT-MINDED AUTHORS AND READERS PROVIDING UNFILTERED POLITICAL NEWS AND POLICY ANALYSIS FROM ACROSS THE POLITICAL SPECTRUM. SINCE 2008 INV.US HAS PUBLISHED THOUSANDS OF ARTICLES FROM JOURNALISTS AND INDIVIDUALS OF DIFFERING POLITICAL TENDENCIES REACHING MORE THAN 500,000 READERS EVERY MONTH PROVIDING NONPARTISAN EDUCATION TO VOTERS AND ENCOURAGING CONSTRUCTIVE DIALOGUE AMONG WRITERS AND READERS ACROSS THE POLITICAL SPECTRUM. IN PURSUIT OF OUR MISSION OF VOTER EDUCATION, WE CONDUCT ONGOING STUDIES TO EXPLORE EFFECTIVE WAYS TO BROADEN THE OUTREACH TO VOTERS IN UNDERSERVED AREAS, WE CONDUCT POLLS TO DETERMINE THE BEST METHODS TO GIVE VOTERS ACCURATE INFORMATION REGARDING THEIR VOTING RIGHTS AN WE PROMOTE INITIATIVES THAT EXPAND THE VOTING POPULATION.</Desc>
